encoding  utf-8
survey Meregill

###Inputs, add surveys here###
input 1/Meregill1 #Mere
input 2/Meregill2 #Torrent to end of pitches
input 3/Meregill3 #Torrent to sumps
input 4/Meregill4 #Torrent and crossover
input 5/Meregill5 #Pitches
input 6/Meregill6 #Bisector
input 7/Meregill7 #branched oxbow
input 8/Meregill8 #terminal sump
input 9/Meregill9 #Where the water goes
input 11/Meregill11 #Beginning of Black Moss passage



###Joins, connecting scraps on the surveys###
join S1@Meregill4 S2@Meregill2
join S1@Meregill2 S8@Meregill3
join S1@Meregill1 S3@Meregill5
join S6@Meregill2 S1@Meregill5
join S1@Meregill5 S4@Meregill4
join S6@Meregill3 S2@Meregill7
join S8@Meregill3 S1@Meregill7
join S1@Meregill8 S1@Meregill3
join S1@Meregill9 S4@Meregill3
join S1@Meregill6 S5@Meregill2
join S3@Meregill4 S1@Meregill11

###Equates, connecting points on surveys###
equate 1@Meregill2 102@Meregill3
equate 6@Meregill2 1@Meregill4
equate 105@Meregill2 120@Meregill4
equate 105@Meregill2 1@Meregill5
equate 64@Meregill5 23@Meregill1
equate 1@Meregill7 90@Meregill3
equate 37@Meregill7 70@Meregill3
equate 12@Meregill8 4@Meregill3
equate 1@Meregill9 38@Meregill3
equate 45@Meregill2 1@Meregill6
equate 1@Meregill11 53@Meregill4




###Map, to create overall map. Input individual survey maps to create the whole###
map plan -projection plan
  plan@Meregill1
  plan@Meregill2
  plan@Meregill3
  plan@Meregill4
  plan@Meregill5
  plan@Meregill6
  plan@Meregill7
  plan@Meregill8
  plan@Meregill9
  plan@Meregill11
endmap

endsurvey

